     <h1 style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14.25pt"> </h1><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">12<span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">23</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日，</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">浙江省教育厅教研室公布</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">了</span>2020<span style="font-family:宋体">年</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">浙江省先进教研组评审结果</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">。我校数学教研组和生物教研组榜上有名，双双荣获</span>“浙江省先进教研组”荣誉称号。</span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></strong></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">本次评比是由学校教研组申报，学校、县（市、区）、设区市逐级推评，最后由省教研室进行抽样考核、终审确定名单并予以公布表彰。我校</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">数学教研组</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">和生物教研组是全市范围内各自学科</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">唯一获此殊荣的教研组。</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">接下来我们将对这些名优教研组分期报道展示，本期我们一起走进数学教研组。</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></strong></p><h1 style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14.25pt"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 22.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial"> </span></strong></h1><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 133.05pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 9.5000"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">一．优秀的教研团队</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></strong></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"> <a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021010416402621.jpg" target="_blank"><img /></a></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">绍兴一中已经培养了包括著名数学家陈建功、陈翰馥父子在内的</span>19<span style="font-family:宋体">位中外院士，是绍兴市首批市级数学学科基地学校。我校数学组曾多次获评绍兴市先进教研组，</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">018</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">年获评绍兴市优秀教研团队，</span>2020<span style="font-family:宋体">年获评浙江省先进教研组。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">数学组现有在岗教师</span>28<span style="font-family:宋体">人，全部具备本科以上学历，其中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">8</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人获硕士学位，中级职称以上占比</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">93%</span><span style="font-family:宋体">，教师结构合理。组内名优教师众多，现有省特级教师</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人、省正高职称教师</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，浙师大硕导、兼职教授</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，绍兴文理学院硕导</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，市拔尖人才</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，全国高中数学联赛金牌教练</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，浙江省数学竞赛金牌教练</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，省教坛新秀</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，浙派名师培养对象</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，省担当作为好支书</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1 </span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，省网络名师工作室主持人</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1 </span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，省级网络学科带头人</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，市级名师工作室主持人</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，市级学科带头人</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，市级教坛新秀</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，市教育事业功臣</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，还有市青年教师“研究者”联盟成员</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"> </span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 126.05pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 9.0000"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">二．鲜明的团队特色</span></span></strong><strong><span class="15" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'"></span></strong></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"> </span><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><span style="font-family:等线">（一）课程设计独到新颖</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"> <a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021010416405904.png" target="_blank"><img /></a></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">数学组抓住课改契机，立足学校文化建设目标，针对学校生源特点，精心制定了《绍兴一中数学学科课程建设规划方案》。该方案构建了数学学科课程建设的基本框架，对标学校整体三级课程体系（元培课程</span>——大通课程——养新课程），着力探索“评价改革背景下的必修课程校本化实施”“学科特色课程群的建设与开发”“学科生本课堂教学的改革”“学科课程资源的建设与应用”以及“学科教师的团队建设”等学科课程建设中的核心问题。如校本特质课程：</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"> <img />

<img />

<img />

<img />
</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"> </span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><span style="font-family:等线">（二）教研活动有声有色</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,255); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">1.长期性集体备课</span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,255); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"></span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family:等线">基本步骤：</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">（</span>1）制订计划 统筹安排</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">（</span>2）共同研讨 集体备课 </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">一周一聚</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"> </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">落实备课</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">    </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">每节一备</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"> </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">专人负责</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">刻苦钻研</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso