t-family:等线">，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">自己动手</span><span style="font-family:等线">编印资料</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><span style="font-family:等线">注意事项：</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"></span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><span style="font-family:等线">明确一个方向：整体统一，个性发挥，百家争鸣，百花齐放；</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><span style="font-family:等线">坚持二项确定：定内容，定主备人；</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; COLOR: rgb(25,25,