</span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><span style="font-family:等线">（三）自编教材精耕细作</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">数学组在日常教研中积累了丰富的教学教研资源，其中有教学设计、教学实录、研讨实录、教辅资料、课题研究资料等。组内老师已将这些资料整理后在正规出版社出版。目前数学组老师参编及主编的书已超过</span>100<span style="font-family:宋体">部，以竞赛辅导资料和校本教材为主，如教研组长虞金龙老师编著的高中数学竞赛专题讲座《平面几何》、苏卫军老师主编的《我和北大学生的解题笔记（数列和数列压轴题）》等。在浙江省网络名师工作室中，虞金龙名师工作室中的数学资源在同类工作室中遥遥领先，这些资料不仅对校内所有老师开放，还对全省教师开放。今年疫情期间，虞老师带领组内工作室成员参与张金良名师工作室组织的“防疫复学驰援武汉”线上支教公益活动，虞老师还为全省师生免费开设网课“高考压轴题专题讲座</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">16</span><span style="font-family:宋体">讲”，受到了师生广泛好评。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021010416435637.png" target="_blank"><img /> </a> </span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 150.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 12.5000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">部分出版的著作</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021010416441268.png" target="_blank"><img /> </a> </span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 150.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 12.5000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">省市级精品课程</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"> </span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"> <img />

