</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 138.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 11.5000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">专题讲座的视频及目录</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><strong><span class="15" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'"><span style="font-family:等线">（</span></span></strong><strong><span class="15" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); mso-spacerun: 'yes'"><span style="font-family:等线">四</span></span></strong><strong><span class="15" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); mso-spacerun: 'yes'"><span style="font-family:等线">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">师徒结对颇具特色</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span></strong></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">数学组一直开展以老带新、以新促老的师徒挂钩拜师传经活动。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">方式一：由中老年教师和青年教师结对子，一帮一，形成师徒关系。每学年都开展</span>“中老年教师示范课、研究课展示”，“青年教师汇报课、优质课比赛”等活动。</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">方式</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">二：借用名师工作室平台，组内年青教师积极加入虞金龙名师工作室，导师虞金龙通过开展同课异构课堂观摩活动以及请校外专家来校做讲座等方式，努力助推年青教师快速成长为名师或业务骨干。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><strong><span class="15" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'"><span style="font-family:等线">（五</span></span></strong><strong><span class="15" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'"><span style="font-family:等线">）教改</span></span></strong><strong><span class="15" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'"><span style="font-family:等线">创新积极</span></span></strong><strong><span class="15" style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'"><span style="font-family:等线">推进</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">数学组教师具有强烈的教学改革和创新意识，积极投身教改项目的研究并积极参加各类培训活动。如苏卫军老师在</span>2015<span style="font-family:宋体">年参加了浙江省教研室举办的“浙江省新高考改革培训”并作专题讲座，在</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2016</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年参加了北京大学举办的大学先修课程《微积分》的师资培训，孔祥新老师在</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2018</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月参加绍兴市数学教学研讨并作了高考热点专题《带绝对值函数的最值问题》讲座，虞金龙老师在</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2020</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月受邀为广西省崇左市“国培计划”项目和新课程标准下的教育教学能力培训作专题讲座，被广西师范大学数学与统计学院聘为专家团成员。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"> </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">  <img />

