</span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">校党委书记、校长王琛作为数学组的一员，教学理念先进，坚守教学改革第一线，现担任高三数学的教学工作。王琛还组织团队力量，成功申报了由中国教研网和人教社组织评审的教研项目</span>——“基于核心素养的高中数学教学策略与方法行动研究”；同时还成功申报了“北京师范大学数学科学学院京师数学建模教育中心基地校”。</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 140.05pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 10.0000"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">三</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">．</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">喜人的教研成果</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></strong></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:等线">（一）突出的竞赛成绩</span></span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,204); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></strong></p><p class="p" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">2</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">001</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">年以来，数学组先后在孟伟强、俞建种、虞金龙、苏卫军、凌晓锋等全国联赛优秀教练和沈栋啸、陈华等省优秀教练的指导下，辅导学生在全国高中数学联赛中获得共获得全国一等奖</span>2</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">8<span style="font-family:宋体">人，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">全国</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">二等奖</span>147<span style="font-family:宋体">人</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">，省一等奖</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">109<span style="font-family:宋体">人</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">等</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">其中</span>3<span style="font-family:宋体">人进冬令营，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">1</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">人进入国家集训队，数学组获</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">全国联赛团体优胜</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">奖。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></span></p><p class="p" style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"> <img />

